Bug 2085557 - Clear Subscribe dialog status after loading. r=mkmelin

Expose the dialog's status feedback as window.MsgStatusFeedback so the
progress timers can start and stop, clearing the Please wait status.
Add regression coverage for clearing the status and hiding progress after
loading IMAP folders.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D337319


